-+// stm32f4_jos.repl - jOS firmware platform for Renode (self-contained)
-+//
-+// IMPORTANT: this file is a VENDORED + MODIFIED copy of the stock Renode 1.16.1
-+// platform files (platforms/cpus/stm32f4.repl + platforms/boards/stm32f4_discovery.repl).
-+// Renode 1.16 does NOT allow overriding peripherals from an included file, so to
-+// set the CPU core clock we must declare the whole platform here.
-+//
-+// Differences vs the stock platform:
-+//   1. dwt: Miscellaneous.DWT @ 0xE0001000 (168 MHz) - added for the DWT cycle
-+//      counter used by rtos_cycle_now(); unmapped in the stock platform.
-+//   2. ccm: Memory.MappedMemory @ 0x10000000 (128 KB) - the release firmware
-+//      places RTOS task stacks / management tables in CCM (.ccm_bss).
-+//
-+// The CPU CORE CLOCK: Renode 1.16 does NOT model a CPU core frequency at all.
